WEBVTT

00:13:30.097 --> 00:13:33.141
So lesson number three is to be brave.

00:13:34.351 --> 00:13:37.271
I believe if you can do
these three things,

00:13:37.312 --> 00:13:39.231
if you can stay curious,

00:13:39.273 --> 00:13:42.484
you can practice humility
and you can be brave,

00:13:42.484 --> 00:13:44.695
then your future self
will look back at you

00:13:44.736 --> 00:13:46.154
in 20 or 30 years --

00:13:46.154 --> 00:13:47.698
will look back,

00:13:47.698 --> 00:13:50.284
not with resentment or bewilderment,

00:13:50.325 --> 00:13:53.537
but will look back at you and say:

00:13:53.579 --> 00:13:54.705
"Thank you."

00:13:56.790 --> 00:14:03.797
(Applause)